#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/installation_and_imports.md:45
msgid "The repository gates and I/O paths depend on the following local conditions on the reference Windows workstation. They are not installed by `pip`, and they qualify a single host environment, not the RELIC package definition."
msgstr "仓库门禁与 I/O 路径依赖参考 Windows 工作站上的下列本地条件。此类条件不通过 `pip` 安装，仅用于限定单台宿主机运行环境，不属于 RELIC 软件包定义本身。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/installation_and_imports.md:49
msgid "`rg` (ripgrep) must be resolvable on `PATH`. The architecture audits under `scripts\\architecture` and the device-policy check `rg \"torch.cuda.is_available\\(\" relic` run it as a subprocess. Verify it with `Get-Command rg` and `rg --version`, and add the actual installation directory to `$env:PATH` when needed. A copy that happens to ship with an editor or assistant installation is not a RELIC package dependency."
msgstr "`rg`（ripgrep）必须能在 `PATH` 上解析到。`scripts\\architecture` 下的架构审计以及 device-policy 检查 `rg \"torch.cuda.is_available\\(\" relic` 会将其作为子进程运行。使用 `Get-Command rg` 和 `rg --version` 进行验证，并在需要时将实际安装目录添加到 `$env:PATH`。恰好随编辑器或助手安装附带的副本不是 RELIC 的包依赖。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/installation_and_imports.md:55
msgid "NetCDF filter plugins: the pip `netCDF4` wheel ships name-mangled copies of `hdf5.dll`, `netcdf.dll`, `zstd.dll`, `blosc.dll`, `libbz2.dll`, `szip.dll` and `zlib.dll` in `netcdf4.libs`, while the HDF5 filter plugins in `netCDF4\\plugins` import them by plain name. Copies of those libraries under their unmangled names must exist in the plugin directory, otherwise every `compression=\"zstd\"` write (the `DataWriter` default) fails with `NetCDF: Filter error: undefined filter encountered`. Importing `netCDF4` alone does not qualify the configured compression: verify the selected filter with a real write/read round trip before using it for scientific outputs, and repeat that qualification after reinstalling or upgrading the native packages, which removes the copies. Host-specific DLL repairs belong to the environment, not to RELIC source or generated documentation."
msgstr "NetCDF filter plugins：pip 的 `netCDF4` wheel 在 `netcdf4.libs` 中附带经过名称改写的 `hdf5.dll`、`netcdf.dll`、`zstd.dll`、`blosc.dll`、`libbz2.dll`、`szip.dll` 和 `zlib.dll` 副本，而 `netCDF4\\plugins` 中的 HDF5 filter plugin 却按原始名称导入它们。这些库以未改写名称存在的副本必须位于 plugin 目录中，否则每次 `compression=\"zstd\"` 写入（`DataWriter` 的默认值）都会以 `NetCDF: Filter error: undefined filter encountered` 失败。仅导入 `netCDF4` 并不能对所配置的压缩进行资格验证：在将其用于科学输出之前，请通过真实的写/读往返验证所选 filter，并在重新安装或升级 native 包之后重复该资格验证，因为这会移除这些副本。特定主机的 DLL 修复属于环境，而不属于 RELIC 源码或生成的文档。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/installation_and_imports.md:67
msgid "`RELIC_SKIP_CALIBRATED`: when set to `1`, `true`, `yes` or `on`, the parameter database manager excludes the calibrated parameter tier for that process. The repository test session sets it to `1` by default, together with `RELIC_SKIP_LEGACY=1`, so test runs use the uncalibrated tiers; production runs must leave both unset to load calibrated values. The public science reference describes the production view, including calibrated parameters; its freshness check therefore runs the generator's `--check` in a child process with `RELIC_SKIP_CALIBRATED`, `RELIC_SKIP_LEGACY` and `RELIC_FAST_INIT` removed from that child's environment. Do not regenerate production defaults from the altered test-session singleton, and do not remove calibration files to make a freshness comparison pass."
msgstr "`RELIC_SKIP_CALIBRATED`：设置为 `1`、`true`、`yes` 或 `on` 时，参数数据库 manager 会在该进程中排除已校准参数层。仓库的测试会话默认将其设为 `1`，并同时设置 `RELIC_SKIP_LEGACY=1`，因此测试运行使用未校准的层；生产运行必须保持二者均未设置，以加载校准值。公开的科学参考描述的是生产视图，包括已校准参数；因此其新鲜度检查在子进程中运行生成器的 `--check`，并从该子进程的环境中移除 `RELIC_SKIP_CALIBRATED`、`RELIC_SKIP_LEGACY` 和 `RELIC_FAST_INIT`。不要从被改动的测试会话 singleton 重新生成生产默认值，也不要为了让新鲜度比较通过而删除校准文件。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/installation_and_imports.md:78
msgid "Experimental data feature flags: placeholder quality-control components in `relic.data.quality` require `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_DATA_QUALITY=1` at import time, and experimental streaming components in `relic.data.streaming` require `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_STREAMING=1`. Both remain disabled by default in standard runs."
msgstr "实验性数据特性开关：`relic.data.quality` 中的占位质量控制组件在导入时需设置 `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_DATA_QUALITY=1`，`relic.data.streaming` 中的实验性流式处理组件需设置 `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_STREAMING=1`。标准运行模式下两者默认均处于关闭状态。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/installation_and_imports.md:83
msgid "Test discovery: the repository test-runner configuration owns discovery (`test_*.py`, `*_test.py`, `*.test.py` and `*.spec.py`, importlib import mode, strict configuration and markers). The test-suite root `conftest.py` skips the Windows `nul` placeholder and any file whose dot-separated stem components are not valid identifiers, including Explorer duplicate copies such as `name (1).py`. This exclusion is a discovery rule, not evidence that the excluded copies were executed or verified. Ruff excludes the same duplicate copies through `extend-exclude` in `pyproject.toml`."
msgstr "测试发现：仓库的 test-runner 配置拥有发现规则（`test_*.py`、`*_test.py`、`*.test.py` 和 `*.spec.py`，importlib import mode，strict 配置与 marker）。测试套件根目录的 `conftest.py` 会跳过 Windows 的 `nul` 占位符，以及任何以点分隔的 stem 组成部分不是有效标识符的文件，包括诸如 `name (1).py` 之类的资源管理器重复副本。该排除是发现规则，而不是被排除副本已被执行或验证的证据。Ruff 通过 `pyproject.toml` 中的 `extend-exclude` 排除同样的重复副本。"

