#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/installation_and_imports.md:94
msgid "On Windows, optional NetCDF compression requires the selected HDF5 filter plugin and its native DLL dependencies inside the active environment. Qualify the chosen compression with an actual write/read round trip before using it for scientific outputs; importing `netCDF4` alone is insufficient. Repeat that qualification after replacing native packages."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，可选的 NetCDF 压缩需要所选的 HDF5 filter plugin 及其 native DLL 依赖位于当前激活的环境中。在将所选压缩用于科学输出之前，请通过实际的写/读往返对其进行资格验证；仅导入 `netCDF4` 是不够的。替换 native 包之后请重复该资格验证。"

